{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人黃心穎與老公泥鯭（黎萬宏）養了兩隻愛犬「可樂」及「Love 」，不時分享與愛犬的生活點滴，日前兩人更為愛犬們慶祝生日，豈料她昨日（14日）突然在社交平台公布噩耗，透露8歲的愛犬「可樂」已經離世，令她大感心痛，她在社交網晒出多張與「可樂」</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T02:13:56.055707+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T02:01:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T02:07:15.536075+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T02:07:15.536075+00:00","content_hash":"81e5eeb7850f525938609b58e476ad5993fde5743dd1f55e0af8ec5f6a166b1f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}